Package: proc-cli
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Semantic CLI tool for process management
 Target by port, PID, name or path. proc finds what listens on a port,
 runs from a directory or holds a file open, and stops, frees, pauses or
 waits for it. Commands that change processes preview with --dry-run and
 ask first, and every command prints JSON with --json for scripts.
